# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# Used ONLY by scripts/ at research time (Phase 2) to verify creators and
# entry videos against the YouTube Data API. The shipped site makes no API
# calls and contains no key — it reads static JSON from /data.
#
# Scope needed: YouTube Data API v3, read-only. No OAuth, no write access.
# Quota: the batch process spends roughly 3 units per creator (channels.list,
# playlistItems.list, videos.list), so ~2,100 units for all 700 creators
# against a 10,000/day default. search.list costs 100 units and is avoided.

YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
